Q: Chrome is blocking third party cookies; asking me to set Same Site attribute = None and Secure, but does not specify how or where? A: <pre><code>// set cookie
app.get(&quot;/set-cookie&quot;, (req, res) =&gt; {
  res.header(&quot;Set-Cookie&quot;, `username=&quot;john doe&quot;; Path=/; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=None;`);
  res.status(200).json({ message: &quot;Cookie has been set&quot; });
});

// clear cookie
app.get(&quot;/clear-cookie&quot;, (req, res) =&gt; {
  res.clearCookie(&quot;username&quot;);
  res.status(200).json({ message: &quot;Cookie has been cleared&quot; });
});
</code></pre>
